WEBVTT

00:02.420 --> 00:04.210
Helck, Vermilio, and the rest of their crew

00:04.210 --> 00:08.670
travel through the toxin-filled lands of the
Demon Realm while heading for Castle Urum.

00:09.210 --> 00:11.960
After they defeat hordes of monsters
blocking their way,

00:11.960 --> 00:17.960
they safely arrive at the castle and
soon engage the winged knights in battle.

00:17.960 --> 00:18.960
However...

01:02.460 --> 01:04.710
Kurui dashita haguruma ga

01:04.710 --> 01:07.380
Kanakirigoe de sakendeiru

01:07.380 --> 01:09.380
Hibana o chirasu unmei

01:09.380 --> 01:12.210
Moeagaru suki o ukagau mitai

01:12.460 --> 01:14.540
Yabai card hikiateta

01:14.540 --> 01:17.170
Pinch no toki koso chance da

01:17.170 --> 01:19.080
Mada akiramete nanka nai

01:19.080 --> 01:21.960
Saigo made tatsu mono ga shousha da

01:22.170 --> 01:24.330
Hohoemi kakeru akuma

01:24.330 --> 01:27.080
To te o toriatte odorou

01:27.080 --> 01:29.330
Narifuri kamau koto wa nai

01:29.330 --> 01:31.670
Gekijou ni yuragu ketsui

01:31.670 --> 01:34.630
Yami ni nomarete shimau mae ni

01:34.830 --> 01:35.500
Break it

01:35.500 --> 01:37.000
Keriagero

01:37.000 --> 01:40.080
Kudakechiru no wa kimi no joushiki da

01:40.080 --> 01:44.630
Dare ni mo makenai honoo kokoro ni daite

01:44.920 --> 01:50.330
Ima hateshinai sekai ni sasageru kono inori ga

01:50.330 --> 01:55.080
Kanau asu ga kuru made taeru koto naku

01:55.080 --> 01:56.710
Moyashi tsuzukeru

01:56.710 --> 01:59.580
It's my soul

02:06.960 --> 02:11.880
<b>Shock</b>

02:12.130 --> 02:12.960
Hey!

02:12.960 --> 02:14.420
You're not supposed to let them beat you!

02:17.330 --> 02:18.540
Oops, too slow!

02:18.540 --> 02:20.330
Nobody lands a hit on me that easily!

02:20.330 --> 02:22.790
Whoa! I'm gonna fall!

02:23.460 --> 02:27.960
Try all you want, but your attacks are powerless
against the might of my impregnable defense!

02:28.080 --> 02:31.290
Bring it on!
You're welcome to strike at me from anywhere!

02:32.460 --> 02:33.460
Too easy!

02:33.920 --> 02:35.210
You greenhorns!

02:44.170 --> 02:47.880
Something must be done or Hyura will be killed.

02:47.880 --> 02:48.750
Yo! Wake up!

02:48.750 --> 02:50.460
Aren't you gonna be the new Demon Lord?!

02:50.830 --> 02:52.000
Just relax!

02:52.000 --> 02:54.540
The lady from management came with us
to handle exactly this type of situation!

03:01.330 --> 03:02.420
Helck!

03:18.170 --> 03:19.040
Stop!

03:19.500 --> 03:20.380
Edil!

03:29.830 --> 03:32.130
So, you were able to tell it was me, eh?

03:34.540 --> 03:36.580
Huh? Someone you know?

03:36.920 --> 03:40.040
I've watched you handle a sword
for many years now.

03:40.040 --> 03:42.000
All it took was a glance.

03:43.420 --> 03:44.630
As impressive as ever.

03:48.170 --> 03:49.420
Sir Helck.

03:51.880 --> 03:55.420
I never thought I'd meet you here.
This is quite a surprise.

03:55.880 --> 03:56.880
Same.

03:57.500 --> 03:59.920
So, they are human after all...

03:59.920 --> 04:00.750
Oh wow.

04:00.750 --> 04:02.920
I was expecting a rugged face
to be hidden under that helmet,

04:02.920 --> 04:05.040
but you actually look kinda feeble.

04:05.670 --> 04:09.420
I take it... that you were able
to retain your personality?

04:09.420 --> 04:10.500
Yes.

04:10.500 --> 04:13.380
It seems I also had
an exceptionally high awakening rate.

04:13.710 --> 04:17.330
However, that meant I was forced
to watch many of my friends suffer

04:17.330 --> 04:19.630
through the awakening process as a result.

04:20.170 --> 04:21.880
To be honest with you,

04:21.880 --> 04:25.080
I would have preferred losing my personality
over going through all that.

04:25.580 --> 04:26.630
Is that so...

04:27.750 --> 04:29.170
This confirms it.

04:29.170 --> 04:31.540
The winged knights are all humans.

04:31.540 --> 04:35.040
They must have used some kind
of sorcery to transform their bodies.

04:35.630 --> 04:37.540
But what do they mean by "awakening"?

04:37.540 --> 04:40.500
Are these winged creatures
supposed to be humankind's true form?

04:40.960 --> 04:42.790
But despite everything, Sir Helck,

04:42.790 --> 04:45.580
I'm happy that I went through
the awakening process.

04:45.580 --> 04:49.580
Because it let me tap into an amazing power
that I can use to fight against the demons.

04:52.420 --> 04:54.960
Each battle that I take part in
causes me to awaken further,

04:54.960 --> 04:56.790
and thereby make me more powerful.

04:57.420 --> 05:01.000
I used to believe I had hit a wall
and would never get any stronger.

05:01.880 --> 05:05.460
But now it feels like my power
will just keep growing and growing indefinitely.

05:08.170 --> 05:10.420
Aw crap! All the other dudes are coming this way!

05:10.420 --> 05:12.000
We gotta hurry and wrap this up!

05:12.460 --> 05:15.460
It's only a matter of time until
even more of my awakened comrades arrive.

05:16.040 --> 05:18.790
Our plan is to invade
further into the Demon Realm,

05:18.790 --> 05:21.250
and engage the demon scourge in battle.

05:22.000 --> 05:23.170
This is bad.

05:23.170 --> 05:26.290
We better hope that not every human
has awakened to this power.

05:26.790 --> 05:29.040
Because if so,
that's a considerable number of troops...

05:33.380 --> 05:36.880
At the same time,
if this is the best they can do in a fight,

05:36.880 --> 05:39.000
then it's more than possible
for us to deal with them.

05:39.000 --> 05:40.250
They may have gotten more powerful,

05:40.250 --> 05:43.330
but that doesn't mean much
when compared to the humans of the past.

05:43.630 --> 05:47.210
A single hero still poses
a much greater threat than any of them.

05:47.500 --> 05:48.500
Helck...

05:48.750 --> 05:50.420
It all comes down to you.

05:50.420 --> 05:54.580
The actions that you take from now on
will heavily impact our future.

05:55.000 --> 05:57.040
The Demon Realm is deep and vast.

05:57.040 --> 05:59.920
There may be other tough foes here
besides the Demon Lord.

06:00.330 --> 06:02.330
But we're not going to flee any more.

06:02.330 --> 06:04.330
We humans aren't the pushovers
that we used to be.

06:04.330 --> 06:06.040
We will claim victory in the end.

06:07.080 --> 06:11.250
We shouldn't have any other problems,
provided that Helck fights on our side.

06:12.080 --> 06:14.790
It's only natural, since we're the same as you...

06:15.330 --> 06:17.750
and have awakened as heroes.

06:19.960 --> 06:21.210
Heroes?

06:21.210 --> 06:24.210
Ridiculous! How is that even possible?!

06:24.330 --> 06:28.130
The previous hero was born
way back 255 years ago.

06:28.130 --> 06:31.040
And currently, there are both Helck
and his younger brother Cless.

06:31.040 --> 06:34.710
Just two of them existing at one time
was already plenty extraordinary!

06:35.750 --> 06:39.420
Besides, these knights are too weak
to be heroes based on what I've seen...

06:39.670 --> 06:41.960
Hold on!
It might be an aptitude problem!

06:41.960 --> 06:44.750
The rate of their awakening
must still be fairly low at this point!

06:44.750 --> 06:48.750
But if that rate increases with time,
they're only going to get stronger!

06:49.500 --> 06:54.170
And if multiple heroes with power on par
to Helck's start showing up one after the other...

06:55.580 --> 06:57.420
the Empire is doomed.

06:58.580 --> 07:01.250
Helck wasn't our only problem!

07:01.250 --> 07:02.710
Infernal humans!

07:02.710 --> 07:05.830
How the hell did they unlock
the secret to awakening that power?!

07:07.960 --> 07:10.790
An era of true peace is close at hand.

07:10.790 --> 07:13.670
We will exterminate the demonic scourge
that is the root of all evil,

07:13.670 --> 07:16.670
and create a perfect world only for us humans!

07:24.580 --> 07:26.500
We're in trouble now! Help!

07:26.500 --> 07:29.380
I really should have taken the time
to eat some beans earlier, huh?

07:29.380 --> 07:31.290
Prepare to die, vile demons!

07:31.830 --> 07:33.420
There is no escape.

07:33.420 --> 07:35.830
You will fall before the
mighty power of humanity's her-

07:42.460 --> 07:44.000
What the?!

07:44.000 --> 07:47.460
"True peace," my ass.
Do you even hear yourself?

07:48.330 --> 07:51.040
We haven't done anything
to deserve this kind of treatment.

07:51.040 --> 07:52.380
You piece of shit.

07:52.790 --> 07:54.130
D-dammit.

07:54.130 --> 07:56.420
I know for a fact I cut off your arm!

07:56.710 --> 07:57.710
Oh yeah?

07:58.130 --> 08:00.960
Well, arms can be regenerated in no time at all.

08:00.960 --> 08:02.170
Everybody knows that.

08:02.170 --> 08:04.460
No way. Arms don't normally do that, right?

08:04.460 --> 08:05.790
They certainly do not.

08:05.790 --> 08:07.080
That's what I figured.

08:07.330 --> 08:08.330
Those two are just totally oblivious
to the gravity of things, I swear.
Ya know what I mean?<b></b>

08:08.330 --> 08:09.290
Those two are just totally oblivious
to the gravity of things, I swear.
Yes indeed.<b></b>

08:09.290 --> 08:09.960
Those two are just totally oblivious
to the gravity of things, I swear.
Like am I right or am I right?<b></b>

08:09.960 --> 08:10.460
Like am I right or am I right?

08:10.460 --> 08:11.420
That regeneration ability
Absolutely right.<b></b>

08:11.420 --> 08:12.130
That regeneration ability

08:12.130 --> 08:14.330
is a well known trait of
members from the Ahald Tribe.

08:14.630 --> 08:18.290
The Ahald Tribe are demons who possess
exceedingly strong regenerative powers

08:18.290 --> 08:21.460
that allow them to heal quickly
from a number of wounds.

08:21.460 --> 08:25.170
This is why some people
have taken to calling them the "Undead."

08:25.420 --> 08:27.210
Hyura let him cut her on purpose.

08:27.670 --> 08:30.790
The enemy leader completely dropped his guard
and now has lost one of his wings.

08:31.540 --> 08:34.170
Although she easily could have ended this
by taking off his head...

08:35.040 --> 08:40.000
Except, I'm guessing she noticed I'm using this fight
to see where Helck's true allegiance lies.

08:40.880 --> 08:41.710
Aw, shucks.

08:41.710 --> 08:45.380
Losing that one wing seems
to have slowed you down pretty heavily.

08:45.380 --> 08:48.670
What's the matter, can't you heroes
even regenerate one measly wing?

08:48.880 --> 08:50.790
Wow! She's really goading them on!

08:51.420 --> 08:52.880
Silence! You freak of nature!

08:53.040 --> 08:54.500
That's just rude.

08:59.630 --> 09:03.130
Too bad that good looks can't save
a rotten personality, you piece of shit!

09:03.460 --> 09:04.830
She's good.

09:04.830 --> 09:09.210
Seems like those "hero" powers of yours
aren't very strong so soon after awakening, huh?

09:10.000 --> 09:11.040
I'm not done yet.

09:11.040 --> 09:14.790
Once my awakening rate boosts high enough,
you'll be nothing more than easy pickings for me.

09:14.790 --> 09:16.130
Oh no, how scary.

09:16.130 --> 09:20.000
Then I guess I'll just have to finish you before
you get the chance to become even stronger, huh?

09:20.000 --> 09:22.420
When this is all over
and I become the new Demon Lord,

09:22.420 --> 09:25.000
I'm going to annihilate every last one
of you goddamn human shit stains.

09:25.000 --> 09:27.210
Y-you're the next Demon Lord?!

09:27.500 --> 09:28.920
That's the plan.

09:28.920 --> 09:30.000
I'm going to kill you!

09:30.000 --> 09:31.130
Fat chance.

09:31.290 --> 09:32.250
She's right.

09:32.250 --> 09:34.960
These knights have only awakened
their potential recently.

09:35.130 --> 09:36.540
Even if they have the powers of a hero,

09:36.540 --> 09:38.580
they don't pose a threat to us
until they've actually honed them.

09:39.130 --> 09:42.580
Humankind has stabbed our Empire in the back
multiple times throughout history.

09:42.580 --> 09:44.330
Peace isn't likely on the table.

09:45.500 --> 09:49.210
Which means there is only one way
for us to avoid the worst possible outcome.

09:49.210 --> 09:51.040
Whoa! Is she using summoning magic?!

09:51.040 --> 09:52.130
How incredible!

09:52.130 --> 09:53.830
That's a multi-summon technique
she's performing!

09:53.830 --> 09:55.580
You only see those once in a blue moon!

10:06.040 --> 10:07.920
We obliterate the humans!

10:14.630 --> 10:15.420
Holy hell!

10:15.420 --> 10:17.580
I thought she was gonna fight,
not blow everything to smithereens!

10:17.580 --> 10:19.420
"Anne from management"
seems like an understatement.

10:19.420 --> 10:21.170
Not just anybody can pull off this feat.

10:21.170 --> 10:25.380
If I didn't have to worry about Helck,
I'd just wipe out the whole lot of them here and now.

10:25.380 --> 10:27.670
But I also have the
tournament finals to consider,

10:27.670 --> 10:29.710
so I'll only reduce
their numbers for the time being.

10:30.000 --> 10:32.420
Welp. Nothing for us to do anymore.

10:32.420 --> 10:33.960
Let's cheer the other two on, eh?

10:33.960 --> 10:34.630
Sounds good.

10:34.630 --> 10:35.630
FIGHT, DAMMIT!

10:37.580 --> 10:38.670
Not my comrades!

10:38.670 --> 10:39.960
Formidable, isn't she?

10:39.960 --> 10:41.250
But you know what?

10:41.250 --> 10:43.170
She's only a member of the management staff.

10:43.750 --> 10:45.290
Are you serious?

10:45.500 --> 10:49.040
Our Empire is teeming with warriors
who are even more powerful than that.

10:49.040 --> 10:52.750
So you can come at us with thousands of heroes
if you want, but they'll never win.

10:52.960 --> 10:54.500
She's great at bluffing.

10:54.500 --> 10:56.040
Now that you know it's hopeless,

10:56.040 --> 10:58.880
apologize for calling me a "freak of nature"
from the bottom of your heart!

10:58.880 --> 11:02.040
Do that and I'll be merciful enough to let you
escape with your life hanging by a thread!

11:02.170 --> 11:04.290
Th-that's what she wants
him to apologize for?!

11:04.290 --> 11:06.130
I guess those words must have stung her a little.

11:06.290 --> 11:08.210
I'll never grovel for mercy from the likes of you!

11:08.210 --> 11:11.790
Mark my words, the day will come
when I bring you to your knees!

11:12.000 --> 11:14.170
I will end your life with my own two hands!

11:15.630 --> 11:16.500
Right.

11:16.500 --> 11:18.670
Well, I'm sorry to say that day is never coming.

11:19.080 --> 11:20.380
Because you're dead!

11:25.710 --> 11:26.750
Helck!

11:29.330 --> 11:30.920
I knew you'd side with them!

11:32.130 --> 11:33.290
He's our enemy!

11:34.130 --> 11:35.000
Hyura...

11:35.000 --> 11:35.880
What is it?

11:36.210 --> 11:38.790
Killing the winged knights is a really bad idea.

11:39.000 --> 11:39.750
Huh?

11:40.130 --> 11:42.130
Sir Helck. I don't believe it...

11:53.080 --> 11:55.710
New troops? Wh-what is going on?

11:55.960 --> 11:57.540
Why attack their own?

11:58.290 --> 11:59.790
Sir Helck...

11:59.790 --> 12:01.750
I take it you already know everything.

12:02.250 --> 12:03.540
But even so, you...

12:03.540 --> 12:04.670
Edil!

12:04.830 --> 12:07.330
Hey! What the hell is going on?!

12:07.580 --> 12:10.960
Just a little longer and the pathway
would have been finished...

12:11.210 --> 12:12.830
but it is what it is.

12:13.460 --> 12:14.580
What pathway?

12:14.580 --> 12:17.830
I have no desire to fight against... you...

12:18.330 --> 12:20.630
Run! Get away from here right now!

12:22.960 --> 12:23.960
What the?!

12:23.960 --> 12:25.080
The floor gave out!

12:25.080 --> 12:26.830
Dammit! What is happening?!

13:02.830 --> 13:05.420
Oh no. That's not good...

13:10.040 --> 13:11.290
Whoa, check it out.

13:11.290 --> 13:14.670
The thing on the bottom is a barrier stone
that wards off the toxin, right?

13:14.670 --> 13:16.170
But what's above it?

13:16.170 --> 13:17.960
I've never seen anything like it.

13:19.380 --> 13:20.540
Ver- Lady Anne!

13:21.130 --> 13:22.290
Hyura.

13:22.290 --> 13:24.670
I'm glad to see that everyone
made it out in one piece.

13:24.670 --> 13:25.500
Yeah.

13:25.500 --> 13:27.540
So what is that thing, Lady Anne?

13:27.750 --> 13:31.000
I'm pretty certain it's a gate that was created
with a spatial-teleportation spell.

13:31.000 --> 13:33.330
Huh? Spatial-teleportation spell?

13:33.330 --> 13:34.920
I've seen it in books pretty often.

13:34.920 --> 13:37.500
It's magic that lets you travel long distances
in a short amount of time, right?

13:37.790 --> 13:39.880
Yes, but I thought
the creation of that spell failed

13:39.880 --> 13:42.880
and everything related to it
was locked away ages ago.

13:42.880 --> 13:44.420
Who would be using it down here?

13:44.670 --> 13:47.750
Well, take a close look at the area
just below the barrier stone.

13:48.460 --> 13:50.710
Those swords belong to the winged knights...

13:50.710 --> 13:51.750
Exactly.

13:51.750 --> 13:55.920
The winged knights cast the spell
and created that gate here.

13:55.920 --> 14:00.790
So this must be the "pathway" that shit stain
with the handsome face was talking about.

14:00.790 --> 14:03.630
But how the hell can they use
such advanced magic?

14:04.040 --> 14:07.630
Okay, so the human realm must be
what's on the other side of that gate, huh?

14:10.670 --> 14:12.880
If you assume the spell actually worked, then yes.

14:13.290 --> 14:16.710
But the spell failed and now the gate
is out of control!

14:16.920 --> 14:19.670
There's no telling where you'll actually end up
if you get sucked into it!

14:19.670 --> 14:21.750
For real?! Oh crap!
Then we gotta run away!

14:21.750 --> 14:23.670
Run where, you idiot?!

14:23.670 --> 14:26.040
It's trying to consume the whole damn castle!

14:26.040 --> 14:27.670
We have to close that gate!

14:31.710 --> 14:33.170
Whoa! A barrier!

14:33.380 --> 14:34.630
Dorsche, my man!

14:34.630 --> 14:35.750
Way to go!
He finally activated his ability, huh?<b></b>

14:35.750 --> 14:36.710
He finally activated his ability, huh?

14:36.710 --> 14:38.670
You must be quiet.

14:42.460 --> 14:46.130
I am concentrating right now.
To retain my focus.

14:47.000 --> 14:49.580
He's got such a calm look on his face...

14:50.540 --> 14:53.380
Anyway, you're a real lifesaver!
Amazing work, dude!

14:53.380 --> 14:54.750
You must be quiet.

14:54.750 --> 14:56.880
Oh yeah, the concentration thing.
Sorry, my bad!

14:57.630 --> 15:00.670
That gate is proving to be
a bigger problem than expected.

15:00.670 --> 15:01.540
Huh?

15:01.540 --> 15:07.540
Normally, my max power barrier would easily
encompass a space as large as this entire room.

15:07.540 --> 15:09.250
But this is all it can manage now.

15:09.250 --> 15:13.750
It seems the suction power of the gate
is so strong that it's even absorbing my barrier.

15:13.920 --> 15:14.580
What?!

15:14.580 --> 15:17.080
So basically, you're saying it won't last very long.

15:17.080 --> 15:18.670
You must be quiet.

15:20.080 --> 15:21.420
That is correct.

15:22.040 --> 15:24.290
Oh, come on!
You're obviously not struggling that much!

15:24.290 --> 15:25.130
Admit it!

15:25.130 --> 15:26.080
Calm down!

15:26.080 --> 15:28.170
We can't afford to break
his concentration right now!

15:38.420 --> 15:40.290
It won't work from this distance, huh?

15:41.420 --> 15:44.500
Dorsche, I'm going to put a stop to that gate.

15:44.830 --> 15:46.670
I need you to hold out until then.

15:46.670 --> 15:48.380
Huh? But how?

15:48.540 --> 15:51.960
If I'm right, that gate is drawing
all its power from the barrier stone.

15:52.250 --> 15:54.170
Which means if I just destroy the stone,

15:54.170 --> 15:56.460
then the gate should
lose its power and disappear.

15:56.580 --> 15:57.460
No way!

15:57.460 --> 15:59.330
Are you going to try
and get closer to it?!

15:59.330 --> 16:00.920
That's too risky!

16:00.920 --> 16:02.670
It's the only option we have.

16:02.960 --> 16:05.000
Dorsche! It's all you!

16:05.000 --> 16:07.670
Roger that, Ver- Ms. Anne.

16:07.670 --> 16:08.960
Please be careful.

16:13.540 --> 16:17.960
Aw man, I wish Helck were here
because I bet he could figure something out.

16:17.960 --> 16:19.710
Where did he get off to?!

16:19.710 --> 16:22.040
Who gives a crap. He's our enemy.

16:22.290 --> 16:24.630
Are you crazy? He's with us!

16:24.630 --> 16:27.290
He stood up for the humans!
Are you blind or what?!

16:31.250 --> 16:33.830
Feast your eyes, you morons.

16:34.170 --> 16:37.920
That explosion did not destroy the stone,
but it did make a crack.

16:38.460 --> 16:39.710
Whoa, awesome!

16:39.710 --> 16:43.000
And that's even with the gate
sucking up a bunch of her power...

16:43.290 --> 16:44.500
Simply incredible.

16:47.500 --> 16:49.420
My next attack will finish this.

16:55.540 --> 16:56.670
Something just hit her!

16:56.670 --> 16:58.210
Oh no! Lady Vermilio!

16:58.420 --> 16:59.250
I have to save her!

16:59.250 --> 17:01.330
Dumbass! You'll just get sucked up
along with her!

17:05.750 --> 17:06.670
Helck!

17:11.290 --> 17:12.790
Take this!

17:15.380 --> 17:16.420
She blew it up!

17:16.420 --> 17:18.580
But she's still in trouble!
The gate won't close right away!

17:20.000 --> 17:21.750
Grab on!

17:26.920 --> 17:30.080
Hold up! You're just being
sucked into the gate, too!

17:30.080 --> 17:32.460
You didn't think at all
before leaping into action, did you?!

17:32.460 --> 17:34.670
FOOL!

17:37.500 --> 17:38.710
The gate is closing!

17:38.710 --> 17:40.210
Lady Vermilio!

17:40.830 --> 17:43.000
I'm... at my limit.

17:59.420 --> 18:02.710
Huff... huff...

18:02.710 --> 18:03.960
It's gone.

18:04.290 --> 18:08.210
Huff... huff...
Oh no. Lady Vermilio...<b></b>

18:10.830 --> 18:12.130
What's going on?

18:12.790 --> 18:15.080
What's this sound I'm hearing?

18:16.130 --> 18:18.710
And what's this aroma?

18:19.330 --> 18:21.210
It's such a nice scent...

18:22.040 --> 18:23.290
Makes me feel at ease...

18:31.170 --> 18:32.460
Oh right.

18:32.460 --> 18:36.380
I remember now,
I got sucked into that gate...

18:36.380 --> 18:38.960
and now I've ended up somewhere else.

18:40.330 --> 18:43.170
It's that scent from earlier.
It was coming from this!

18:45.750 --> 18:48.290
AW, HELL! THIS IS HELCK'S CRUMMY CAPE!

19:07.710 --> 19:10.420
Wh-where am I right now?

19:18.710 --> 19:21.500
Yakusoku suru yo

19:21.500 --> 19:24.460
Itsuka sekai ga

19:24.460 --> 19:26.540
Owaru toki mata

19:26.540 --> 19:29.170
Deaemasu you ni

19:41.250 --> 19:46.630
Hana no you na hito datta to

19:46.630 --> 19:52.540
Dareka ga chiisaku tsubuyaiteita

19:52.540 --> 19:58.080
Mizu no nai heya soredemo tashika ni

19:58.080 --> 20:00.580
Asu e saiteita

20:02.290 --> 20:05.080
Zenbu yume dattara

20:05.080 --> 20:07.960
Kimi o shiru koto mo

20:07.960 --> 20:10.880
Koi o suru koto mo

20:10.880 --> 20:14.380
Ikiru imi sae shirazu ni

20:15.210 --> 20:18.000
Tatoeba asu ga

20:18.000 --> 20:20.710
Donna ame demo

20:20.710 --> 20:23.080
Yoru wa ake sekai ni

20:23.080 --> 20:26.170
Niji ga kakaru you ni

20:26.540 --> 20:29.290
Mune no itami mo

20:29.290 --> 20:32.170
Tsutau namida mo

20:32.170 --> 20:35.580
Mirai e no tane ni kaete

20:35.580 --> 20:37.210
Ikiyou

20:37.920 --> 20:39.960
Bukiyou na ai ga

20:39.960 --> 20:43.130
Hana o sakasu made

20:45.460 --> 20:52.130
<b>Prior to Vermilio's Departure</b>

20:45.750 --> 20:47.960
Wait! Please reconsider this!

20:47.960 --> 20:49.380
Enough! Just shut up!

20:49.380 --> 20:50.500
You know this is the one time

20:50.500 --> 20:52.170
that we can't afford to do a half-ass job!

20:52.170 --> 20:53.880
I understand why you feel that way,

20:53.880 --> 20:56.580
but you don't have to go the extreme
of lopping off your hair!

20:56.710 --> 20:58.210
I'm not just being gung-ho about it!

20:58.210 --> 21:01.250
I want to do this because it's easier to travel
when my hair is short!

21:01.250 --> 21:03.080
Okay, fine! But hear me out!

21:03.080 --> 21:05.130
I love your long locks!

21:05.330 --> 21:08.670
And as far as I'm concerned,
Vermikins with short hair just isn't Vermikins at all!

21:09.250 --> 21:11.460
I don't care! Quit calling me that!

21:11.460 --> 21:16.000
Please calm down, Lord Azudra.
Or you're going to faint from blood loss again.

21:16.000 --> 21:17.290
You stay out of this!

21:17.580 --> 21:19.500
He's actually serious about this...

21:19.750 --> 21:20.920
All right.

21:20.920 --> 21:23.130
If you insist on cutting
your hair no matter what,

21:23.130 --> 21:25.830
then it's just going to have to be
over my dead body.

21:30.960 --> 21:32.380
Medic team!

21:32.380 --> 21:33.170
On it!

21:33.170 --> 21:36.040
Lord Azudra's in critical condition!

21:36.500 --> 21:38.880
Okay. That takes care of the interloper.

21:38.880 --> 21:39.920
Now give me a haircut.

21:39.920 --> 21:42.210
A-are you positive about this?

21:42.750 --> 21:44.040
Not you too!

21:44.040 --> 21:45.670
Quit making a big deal about this!

21:45.670 --> 21:48.080
It's not like I'm dead,
so my hair will grow back with time!

21:48.710 --> 21:51.210
Okay... fair enough.

21:52.130 --> 21:55.210
Just please make sure
you come back to us alive, okay?

21:55.210 --> 21:56.210
Count on it.

21:59.460 --> 22:00.420
Crap!

22:00.420 --> 22:04.170
Oh, Lord Azudra.
Welcome back to the land of the living.

22:04.170 --> 22:05.330
VERMIKINS!

22:05.330 --> 22:06.540
Somebody stop him!

22:06.540 --> 22:07.960
He's about to do something stupid again!

22:07.960 --> 22:09.080
STAND ASIDE!
He's about to do something stupid again!<b></b>

22:09.880 --> 22:12.040
How does he have so much energy?

22:12.040 --> 22:13.080
Vermikins!

22:13.080 --> 22:15.960
That long hair is an absolutely essential part
of who you are!

22:15.960 --> 22:18.790
I'll do whatever it takes to stop you from cutting it,
even if it kills me!

22:22.170 --> 22:24.330
Stop right there!

22:26.830 --> 22:28.130
You're too late.

22:28.130 --> 22:29.750
Say goodbye to my long hair.

22:32.630 --> 22:33.790
It's already been cut!

22:34.330 --> 22:35.830
No, it cannot be!

22:36.290 --> 22:38.580
But actually, you know what?

22:38.920 --> 22:40.130
This is fine too...

22:40.130 --> 22:41.710
Lord Azudra!

22:41.710 --> 22:43.040
Just leave him there!

22:45.920 --> 22:50.710
<b>Next Episode</b>

22:45.920 --> 22:50.710
<b>The Remote Island Village</b>

22:46.710 --> 22:49.290
Next time: "The Remote Island Village"
